# Suspicious Parent-Child — SPL Queries

## Query 1: Verify Sysmon Process Creation

```spl
index=main source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| table _time ComputerName User ParentImage Image CommandLine
| sort - _time
```

Purpose: Confirm that Sysmon process-creation events contain the required fields.

## Query 2: Find Command Prompt Process Creation

```spl
index=main source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| search Image="*cmd.exe"
| table _time ComputerName User ParentImage Image CommandLine
| sort - _time
```

Purpose: Find process-creation events involving Command Prompt.

## Query 3: Detect Office Applications Launching Scripting Tools

```spl
index=main source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| eval ParentProcess=lower(ParentImage), ChildProcess=lower(Image)
| where (
    like(ParentProcess, "%\\winword.exe")
    OR like(ParentProcess, "%\\excel.exe")
    OR like(ParentProcess, "%\\powerpnt.exe")
    OR like(ParentProcess, "%\\outlook.exe")
)
| where (
    like(ChildProcess, "%\\powershell.exe")
    OR like(ChildProcess, "%\\pwsh.exe")
    OR like(ChildProcess, "%\\cmd.exe")
    OR like(ChildProcess, "%\\wscript.exe")
    OR like(ChildProcess, "%\\cscript.exe")
    OR like(ChildProcess, "%\\mshta.exe")
)
| table _time ComputerName User ParentImage Image CommandLine
| sort - _time
```

Purpose: Identify selected Office-to-script process relationships.

## Query 4: Summarize Observed Parent-Child Relationships

```spl
index=main source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| stats count by ParentImage Image
| sort - count
| head 50
```

Purpose: Establish a baseline of common process relationships on the endpoint.

## Query 5: Verify the Controlled PowerShell-to-CMD Test

```spl
index=main source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| eval ParentProcess=lower(ParentImage), ChildProcess=lower(Image)
| where like(ParentProcess, "%\\powershell.exe")
    AND like(ChildProcess, "%\\cmd.exe")
| table _time ComputerName User ParentImage Image CommandLine
| sort - _time
```

Purpose: Verify the benign PowerShell-to-CMD test if the event was generated and ingested.
